        "Description": "Ten days ago, we got reports that the target was still alive. She was rescued by a Belizean fisherman who found her drifting in the Caribbean. Our &quot;friends&quot; at Providence suspect she could be a double agent. She is being held for interrogation at a hidden facility in the streets of Chongqing. The other target is being held in the same area. Find them both and do what you do best.",
